Used under the MIT License (https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT), as a Go
module: github.com/bluenviron/mediacommon/v2 at 75fa748 (go.mod).

What is used from it (issue #817): its fmp4 package writes each segment of a
take, an init with the segment's SPS and PPS and fragments after it, and its
h264 package turns scrcpy's Annex B into the AVCC samples of MP4
(internal/node/device, segment.go).
